    "Do not apply inherited blanket1mm capacitor limit to bulk-bank, feedforward or load distribution. Input C213→U_FAN VIN target2.2mm port-center /1mm outside copper; BST target3mm center /1mm outside copper; output nearest capacitor target4mm. Explicit ground capacitor escapes require1.2–2.2mm port-center traces because via copper must remain0.3mm beyond pad edges.",
    "Only low-current sense/debug branches may use a single signal barrel. Fan load or PGND layer transfers use the declared parallel arrays; no one-via current neck.",
    "All array barrels require top/bottom1.2mm same-net connecting bars as applicable; the first barrel path alone is not electrical completion of the array.",
    "No broad FAN_SW polygon is requested. The top SW strip passes between SOT23 pad rows and beneath the component body, with compact local bootstrap branches.",
